    "Optics": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光学"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在绘画工具中，按住 Option 键可临时切换为吸管。Shift 键用于约束形状或移动方向，或添加到选区；Option 键用于从选区中减去，或从中心绘制。按住 Command 键拖动可移动所选像素；按住 Command-Option 键拖动可拷贝像素。按住 Option 键拖动可复制图层、文件夹和效果；在图层边界按住 Option 键点按可切换剪贴蒙版。按住 Command 键点按缩略图可载入其选区。按住 Control 键可绕过对齐。按住右键拖动可调整画笔大小。修饰键与鼠标手势是固定的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click to set the source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Option 键点按以设置取样源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click where Clone Stamp should copy from first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先按住 Option 键点按仿制图章要拷贝的来源位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
